---
import { categories, categoryPath, type Store } from '../lib/oshen-stores';
interface Props { store?: Store; category?: string }
const { store, category } = Astro.props;
const title = store ? `${store.name}｜${store.category}｜我們的洋流地圖` : category ? `${category}店家｜我們的洋流地圖` : '我們的洋流地圖｜一起走走，讓支持成為日常。';
const description = store ? `${store.name}，${store.category}，位於${store.address}。查看店家資訊、官方社群與洋流地圖，規劃前往路線。` : category ? `探索洋流地圖收錄的${category}店家，查看店家地址、資訊與地圖，規劃前往路線。` : '我們的洋流地圖，一起走走，讓支持成為日常。喝杯咖啡、吃頓飯，或到一家小店逛逛。打開地圖，找找今天想去的地方。';
const canonical = new URL(store ? `/puma_oshen_wave/shops/${encodeURIComponent(store.id)}/` : category ? categoryPath(category) : '/puma_oshen_wave/', Astro.site).href;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<script is:inline defer src="/assets/analytics.js?v=20261019-content-group"></script>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#ff3476"><meta name="description" content={description}>
<title>{title}</title>
<link rel="canonical" href={canonical}>
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:locale" content="zh_TW">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="MiniCourse">
<meta property="og:title" content={title}>
<meta property="og:description" content={description}>
<meta property="og:url" content={canonical}>
<meta property="og:image" content="https://minicourse.dev/puma_oshen_wave/assets/our-ocean-map-hero.png?v=20261025-ocean-guide">
<meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png">
<meta property="og:image:width" content="2172">
<meta property="og:image:height" content="724">
<meta property="og:image:alt" content="我們的洋流地圖 — 洋流帶路，讓支持成為日常">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/puma_oshen_wave/vendor/leaflet/leaflet.css"><script is:inline defer src="/puma_oshen_wave/vendor/leaflet/leaflet.js"></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/puma_oshen_wave/vendor/leaflet-markercluster/MarkerCluster.css"><script is:inline defer src="/puma_oshen_wave/vendor/leaflet-markercluster/leaflet.markercluster.js"></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/puma_oshen_wave/style.css?v=20261028-stage-entry"><script is:inline type="module" src="/puma_oshen_wave/app.js?v=20261031-legislator-marker-size"></script>
</head>
<body>

<main id="page-top">
<nav class="directory-tabs" aria-label="洋流名錄">
  <button id="shops-tab" type="button" aria-pressed="true" aria-controls="shops-directory">洋流店家</button>
  <a id="designers-tab" href="/puma_oshen_wave/designer/">洋流設計師</a>
  <a id="stages-tab" href="/puma_oshen_wave/stage/">洋流舞台</a>
</nav>
<div id="shops-directory">
<section class="title-scene imagegen-hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
  <div class="hero-banner">
  <h1 id="page-title" class="hero-art"><img src="/puma_oshen_wave/assets/our-ocean-map-hero.webp?v=20261025-ocean-guide" width="1280" height="427" alt="我們的洋流地圖 — 洋流帶路，讓支持成為日常" fetchpriority="high"></h1>
  <div class="hero-actions"><button type="button" id="share-open" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="share-dialog">分享給朋友</button><a id="join-map" href="https://forms.gle/1M9SYBFmCK5YQ57w7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">加入地圖</a><a id="recommend-map" href="https://forms.gle/K6WHW1phbSmUtKmb6" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">推薦加入</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="page-intro">
    <p>喝杯咖啡、吃頓飯，或到一家小店逛逛。<br>有些地方你已經很熟悉，有些還等著你走進去。</p>
    <p>打開我們的洋流地圖，找找今天想去的地方。</p>
    <p>別忘了點點地圖上的幸運星</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="finder" aria-labelledby="finder-title">
  <a class="finder-marquee" href="https://forms.gle/1M9SYBFmCK5YQ57w7">
    <div class="marquee-window"><h2 id="finder-title" class="marquee-track"><span>來吧!來吧！讓我們知道要收錄你！</span><span aria-hidden="true">來吧!來吧！讓我們知道要收錄你！</span></h2></div>
  </a>
  <button id="category-toggle" class="mobile-control" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="category-filters">店別：{category || store?.category || '全部店家'} ▾</button>
  <div class="controls"><div id="category-filters" class="category-filters" role="group" aria-label="店別篩選">{['', ...categories].map(label => <a class="category-button" role="button" aria-pressed={(category || store?.category || '') === label} href={label ? categoryPath(label) : '/puma_oshen_wave/'} aria-current={(category || store?.category || '') === label ? 'page' : undefined}>{label || '全部店家'}</a>)}</div></div>
</section>
<section class="map-workspace" id="map-area" aria-label="店家清單與地圖">
  <div class="mobile-views" role="group" aria-label="瀏覽方式"><button type="button" id="list-view" aria-pressed="true">店家清單</button><button type="button" id="map-view" aria-pressed="false">查看地圖</button></div>
  <aside class="shop-panel"><section id="shop-detail" class="shop-detail" hidden={!store} aria-label="選定店家資訊"><slot name="detail" /></section><div id="shop-list" aria-live="polite" hidden={!!store}><slot /></div></aside>
  <div class="map-column"><div class="map-frame"><div class="map-bar"><div><span class="location-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><strong id="location-name">台南火車站</strong><span class="map-label">OPENSTREETMAP</span></div><button id="home-map" type="button">我的位置</button></div><div id="lucky-star-message" class="lucky-star-message" hidden><img src="/puma_oshen_wave/assets/lucky-star.png" width="28" height="28" alt=""><p id="lucky-star-text" role="status"></p><button id="close-star" type="button" aria-label="關閉幸運星訊息">×</button></div><div class="map-canvas"><div id="all-shops-map" hidden aria-label="所有店家位置"></div><button id="lucky-star" type="button" disabled title="幸運星" aria-label="幸運星"><img src="/puma_oshen_wave/assets/lucky-star.png" width="34" height="34" alt=""></button></div><p id="map-status" role="status" hidden></p></div></div>
</section>
<p class="closing-strip closing-message">一間店、一個地方，讓我們的洋流繼續流動。</p>
</div>
<section id="designers-directory" class="designer-directory" hidden aria-labelledby="designers-title">
  <header class="designer-heading"><h2 id="designers-title">洋流設計師</h2></header>
  <div id="designer-list" class="designer-list" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <article id="designer-detail" class="designer-detail" hidden aria-label="設計師詳細資訊"></article>
</section>
</main>

<footer><strong>我們的洋流地圖</strong><a href="#page-top">回到上方 ↑</a>
<section class="map-legend" aria-label="地圖標記說明">
  <ol>
    <li><strong>各服務處</strong><p>以各服務處的人像作為地圖標記。</p></li>
    <li><strong><span class="legend-color legend-pink" aria-hidden="true"></span>桃紅色</strong><p>目前第一批上線、經我們邀請，或已同意我們上架的店家。<br>店家名稱下方也會亮起<span class="legend-orange-line">橘色光條</span>。</p></li>
    <li><strong><span class="legend-color legend-light-green" aria-hidden="true"></span>淺綠色</strong><p>在網路上看到，但還沒有正面同意收錄的店家。</p></li>
  </ol>
</section>
<p id="map-statement" class="footer-disclaimer"><strong>本地圖不代表任何人、事、務</strong><br><strong>未有任何人、組織贊助</strong><br><strong>不接受任何人、組織贊助</strong></p><p class="footer-notice">本網頁由 <a href="https://minicourse.dev" style="text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px">MiniCourse</a> 製作，所有店家資訊均為各家所有，本站僅整理，不保證百分之百正確</p><p class="footer-notice">部分店家座標資料 © <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OpenStreetMap contributors</a>（ODbL）</p></footer>
<dialog id="share-dialog" aria-labelledby="share-title" aria-describedby="share-description">
  <h2 id="share-title">我們的洋流地圖</h2>
  <p id="share-description">分享給朋友，下次一起去。</p>
  <img src="/puma_oshen_wave/assets/map-share-qr.svg" width="264" height="264" alt="我們的洋流地圖 QR Code，掃描開啟 https://minicourse.dev/puma_oshen_wave/">
  <a id="share-url" href="https://minicourse.dev/puma_oshen_wave/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://minicourse.dev/puma_oshen_wave/</a>
  <div class="share-actions"><button id="share-copy" type="button" autofocus>複製連結</button><form method="dialog"><button>關閉</button></form></div>
  <p id="share-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
</dialog>
</body></html>
